\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Ngl, I spent a lot of time considering Catholicism but the whole legalism with mortal/venial sin, culpability, conscience examination, and state of grace just turn this religion into OCD generator. It is clear that Joe got into scrupulosity crisis, over analyzing-every video he made to ensure there is no chance he committed a mortal sin by still having them accessible.}
